    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel so heavy. like every single thing i have to do, even just breathing or waking up, feels like i'm trying to run a marathon through deep mud. i'm just so incredibly tired of trying to keep my head above water. it feels like i've been running on empty for years and there's just nothing left.",
