      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you feel this isolation and the intense pressure to be \"better\" when you feel like you have no energy left to give. It is a heavy and unfair burden to feel like you are taking up space for someone \"better\" when you are simply trying to stay alive through the pain. Please consider reaching out to a suicide prevention helpline like 988 or 24 help for 247, as they can listen to you gently and help you find support that you don't feel like you need to give to yourself.",
      "source": "target",
