      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so deeply sorry that you feel this hopelessness and the exhaustion of \"fighting\" when it feels impossible to do so. Please hear me when I say that it is okay to not want to fight right now, and that your pain is valid. If you feel you must end it all to stop the pain, I can help you find a safe, immediate connection to support you through this moment.",
